1. dwm  -  https://dwm.suckless.org/
==============================================================================

What is derived from it:

  * The layout algorithms in src/layouts.zig: tile, monocle, centeredmaster
    and deck, ported to Zig from dwm's C code (config.def.h and dwm.c).
  * The ideas behind the program: tags, master/stack layouts, monitors, and a
    configuration that is compiled into the program.
  * The centeredmaster layout comes from the dwm "centeredmaster" patch
    (suckless.org patch page; credited there to Laslo Hunhold).
  * The deck layout comes from the dwm "deck" patch (suckless.org, version
    dwm-deck-6.2 by Jack Bird).

